        "identifier": "https://github.com/zblore/csd-lean4/blob/30850da3f5669dc02aac297043819bc5f854dc2f/CsdLean4/Mathlib/QuantumInfo/SolovayKitaevCount.lean",
        "note": "My larger Lean project, where this proof was written. The theorem exists_word_approx_polylog was first proved there on 6 October 2026 (commit 01e973e9), with the density of the Clifford+T group (26 September) and the commutator decomposition, error recursion and word-length recursion (6 October). This repository copies the fifteen files of its import closure from commit 30850da3 with the code unchanged, except that two definitions were moved earlier in one file, and the comments edited. New here: SolovayKitaevLean/Basic.lean (the two Challenge statements) and the controls.",
        "relationship": "builds-on"
